WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.247 --> 00:00:07.058
The cards are torn, folded and upside down, and the lamp cannot read them!

3
00:00:07.769 --> 00:00:11.036
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:14.034
This is Episode 81.

5
00:00:14.745 --> 00:00:16.644
Meet the sticky-pot.

6
00:00:17.355 --> 00:00:19.489
Its brush gets to work.

7
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.429
Flatten the folded ones.

8
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.452
Flip the upside-down ones.

9
00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:28.721
Stick the torn ones back together.

10
00:00:29.432 --> 00:00:31.744
Trim them all to one size.

11
00:00:32.455 --> 00:00:35.285
Then one neat stack, all facing up.

12
00:00:35.996 --> 00:00:39.663
Now the lamp shines, and the answer floats up at once.

13
00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:42.780
Clean first, then ask.

14
00:00:43.491 --> 00:00:45.802
That is AWS Glue.

15
00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:50.558
It cleans and tidies messy data so the other helpers can use it.

16
00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:53.404
Now you know the sticky-pot!

17
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

